{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>東涌發生致命車禍。前日（6日）一輛龍運巴士與一輛電單車在東涌東交匯處迴旋處相撞，電單車被捲入巴士車頭，58歲姓李男鐵騎士全身多處嚴重受傷，被送往北大嶼醫院搶救，留醫約14小時後，延至昨日（7日）早上8時35分證實不治。</p><p>60歲黃姓男車長將被暫控一項「危險駕駛導致他人死亡」罪，案件將於今日（8日）上午於屯門裁判法院提堂。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事電單車捱撞後被推前約20米，卡在巴士車頭位置。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112332436869120572136.jpeg/gPKdizNPgYu8ztCp5tgb-tIYXCWd16dRgQ4mIZcOJiE\"/><figcaption>涉事電單車捱撞後被推前約20米，卡在巴士車頭位置。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><p>事發在8月6日傍晚6時許，一輛龍運巴士與一輛電單車同沿東涌東交匯處行駛，巴士在迴旋處時由中圈行駛，其後撞倒外圈一輛電單車，電單車被捲入巴士車頭。</p><figure><img alt=\"涉事鐵騎士倒地昏迷。（FB／香港公共交通智庫）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162126726596136960367509.jpeg/kWIEcn06QX-2fGb5V2We82JDmBA7O4DJ3BS0htwUtIY\"/><figcaption>涉事鐵騎士倒地昏迷。（FB／香港公共交通智庫）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電單車頭盔遺留在地上。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112585558921216160375.jpeg/L5dF7mQG7GCOygsH18neglBczQWFnF242Wj-Is9o_iI\"/><figcaption>電單車頭盔遺留在地上。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"東涌一輛巴士電單車相撞，鐵騎士不省人事送院搶救。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162105879001042944678951.jpeg/jxj7-egPvumgMZV-KqRl7lmbg5gJfZFICOMbFQjjGxU\"/><figcaption>東涌一輛巴士電單車相撞，鐵騎士不省人事送院搶救。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"巴士司機登上協助調查。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162113126645108736560937.jpeg/teRkrWuFHDwXg4NP9AciyUSXj05r4Yj9Uq7IO0SuyDs\"/><figcaption>巴士司機登上協助調查。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112975364952064853247.jpeg/u_nvg5W3AZCmbR4YQ3JM11OJkOQv920h0q7DbdKuw20\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112978087186432132496.jpeg/ZmLnNVhb7yURcmDrsncOtZZ8gugAeLU90tzz1tLc89Y\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員到場調查。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112981413400576418093.jpeg/KH3Ansu-ngYV6vD66jzdCF0SuxrY1XTLQLticEC7YnA\"/><figcaption>警員到場調查。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電單車手套遺留在地上。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112983825256448670814.jpeg/_jFVy1sYHPaOP2nFyNANZBQI-KoDr6yBh2ni7Ydp4u0\"/><figcaption>電單車手套遺留在地上。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"電單車頭盔遺留在地上。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112986518130688413589.jpeg/6jV5XVDlAYK1R_6skucm6dL66DfeRadoGyMFlRsjBZU\"/><figcaption>電單車頭盔遺留在地上。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事電單車卡在巴士車頭。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112968414990336165032.jpeg/NwQSSLW7v-sB11MyCq9zSmAeEkTAdfQDZ0VewWdFXsE\"/><figcaption>涉事電單車卡在巴士車頭。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事電單車卡在巴士車頭。（林振華攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260806/1162112971284025344065243.jpeg/JSNFxMvPBYasJ7SFEGLbDpVhWAoY1518yGq498hquPc\"/><figcaption>涉事電單車卡在巴士車頭。（林振華攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-08T01:29:21.168829+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":472,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}